Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex. Do not interrupt me when I'm daydreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,When a zebra's in the zone, leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Marty. Just wanted to wish you a happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:33.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I got something stuck in my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:41.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's driving me crazy. Can you help me? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You came to the right place, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Marty, D.D.S. , is in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:52.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please hop on top of my sterilized examination table, if you may.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:56.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't see anything. - It's on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:57.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, just don't talk with your mouth full.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:04.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here. What the heck is this doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, hey, thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You put it in behind the tooth. You all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,These aren't even on the shelf yet. Here. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at that. Ooh! Look at that. - Look at that. It's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten years old, huh? A decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:25.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Double digits. The big 1-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, no, it's great. - You hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should've gotten you the Alex alarm clock. That's the big seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. The present's great, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that another year's come and gone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'm still doing the same old thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Stand over here. Trot over there. Eat some grass. Walk back over here. "
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I see your problem. - Maybe I should go to law school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:53.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just need to break out of that boring routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How? - Throw out the old act.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who knows what you'll do. Make it up as you go along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:03:01.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ad lib. Improvise. On the fly. Boom, boom, boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:03.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Really? - You know, make it fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fresh, huh? Okay. I could do fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here come the people, Marty. I love the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's fun people fun time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Gloria! Up and at 'em. We're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:22.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,What day is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Friday. Field trip day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:28.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's field trip day. Let's get up and go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,... in ten more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, Melman, Melman! Melman, Melman, Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Rise and shine! It's another fabulous morning in the Big Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not for me. I'm calling in sick. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:49.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I found another brown spot on my shoulder. Right here. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:51.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right there. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:54.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, you know it's all in your head. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:11.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Phil! Wake up, you filthy monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to be fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:21.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Straight out the ground. Tasty fresh! Freshalicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ziploc fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:27.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, children of all ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Central Park Zoo proudly presents:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:31.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Show them the cat. Who's the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The king of New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex the lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:59.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gather around, people. Big show about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check out the zebra taking care of biz. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:39.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just smile and wave, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smile and wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kowalski, progress report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're 500 feet from the main sewer line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:49.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And the bad news? - We've broken our last shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:50.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:54.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico, you're on litter patrol. We need shovels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:58.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,And find more Popsicle sticks. We don't want to risk another cave-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,And me, skipper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to look cute and cuddly, private.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Today we're going to blow this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here. Come here. Come on, penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You don't see that on Animal Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:21.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, show's over, folks. Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you thought it was fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be here all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll be here for my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three hundred and sixty-five days a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:34.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,including Christmas, Hanukkah, Halloween, Kwanzaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget to never spay or neuter your pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:42.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,And tip your cabbie, because he's broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, quadruped. Sprechen sie Englisch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I sprechen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What continent is this? - Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hoover Dam! We're still in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Abort. Dive! Dive! Dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:04.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. You in the tux. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're digging to Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ant-who-tica?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you keep a secret, my monochromatic friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you ever see any penguins running free around New York City?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:27.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course not. We don't belong here. It's just not natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is all some kind of whacked-out conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:34.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going to the wide-open spaces of Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,To the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,The wild? You could actually go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:42.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:48.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up. Where is this place? Tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,For his final appearance of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,the king of New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex the lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys are great. You're a great crowd. Give yourselves a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:20.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Oh. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Well. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too kind. Too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Underpants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:31.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody get home safe. Hey! Check out my Web site.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four hour Alex Cam. Watch me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:01.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ooh, it's Marty's birthday. - Just rip it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is it? - Come on. Open it up. What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:05.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,A thermometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I love it, Melman. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:15.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you something personal. That was my first rectal thermometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mother... - I'll miss that bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:18.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the cake. Melman, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You live in a zoo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look like a monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you smell like one too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:39.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, well, now, you guys are just embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,And yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? We worked on that all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:46.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's make a wish, babycakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What'd you wish for? - Nope. Can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No siree. I'm telling you, it's bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want some bad luck, I'll blab it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if you want to be safe, I'll keep my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you just tell us? What could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:12.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wished I could go to the wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,The wild? !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you it was bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,The wild? Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is the worst idea I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's unsanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:33.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,The penguins are going. So why can't l?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:34.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,The penguins are psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Just imagine going back to nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back to your roots. Clean air, wide-open spaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:44.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear there's wide-open spaces in Connecticut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:47.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Connecticut? - You got to go over to Grand Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you got to take the Metro-North train... north?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:55.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,So one could take the train? Just hypothetically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:58.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. What would Connecticut have to offer us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lyme disease. - Thank you, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I just want...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's none of this in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:07.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a highly refined type of food thing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,that you do not find in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ever thought there might be more to life than steak, Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:15.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean that, baby. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:19.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it bother you guys that you don't know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:21.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,about life outside this zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nuh-uh. Nope. - Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:28.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, come on. That's just one subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a little schmutz right there on your... .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. Thanks for the party. It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's eating him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:55.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should talk to him. Go over and give him a little pep talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:59.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I already gave him a snow globe. I can't top that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alex. - I can see where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is getting late. I guess I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. He's your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, all right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:25.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Night, Marty. - Night, Glo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:54.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, I tell you, it just doesn't get any better than this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:58.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh! It just did. Even the star's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:02.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not going to find a star like that in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:03.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty. Buddy. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:13.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody has days when they think the grass might be greener somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:14.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:20.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm ten years old. My life is half over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I don't even know if I'm black with white stripes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,... or white with black stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex. Please. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:42.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. It's a wonderful song. I think you're familiar with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Oh, no, you don't. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Start spreadin' the news
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving today
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:14:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We are a great big part of it - He's funny. Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:04.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. You know you know the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two little words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,New York
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up, shut up, shut up! Hey, I'm sleeping here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:14.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not all nocturnal, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:17.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll knock your "turnal" right off, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you and what army, stripes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:22.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mess with him, you mess with me, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're a bigmouth lion. - See? Mr. Grumpy Stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We make a great team, the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We sure do. No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:35.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do? Go running off to the wild by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:38.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - The wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. You and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a straight shot down Fifth Avenue to Grand Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll grab a train, we'll head north.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:49.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can be back by morning. No one will ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:51.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're joking. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:59.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm joking. Of course I'm joking. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like we're going to get a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do that. You really had me worried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:09.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. I guess I'll hit the sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:13.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too. I'll need to rest my voice for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Seniors' Day, you know. Have to roar extra loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:19.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give them a little jolt. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good night, AllyAl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,They forgot to turn off the ambience again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, now, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,My little filet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,My little filet mignon with a little fat around the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like that. I like a little fat on my steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,My sweet, juicy steak. You are a rare delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex. Alex. Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You suck your thumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:35.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it, Melman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:38.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ok! Ok! You know how I have that bladder infection
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I have to get up every two hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:44.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got up to pee and looked over at Marty's pen, which I usually don't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I did. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Marty. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gone! What do you mean, "gone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:55.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long has he been working on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't fit down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:02.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty? Marty! Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense. Where would he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Connecticut! - He wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:15.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, we got to call somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Get me Missing Animals. And hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:25.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got a lost zebra probably on the way to Connecticut, and we need...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello? Hello? - Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:33.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can't call the people. - What the... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll be really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:40.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll get Marty transferred for good. Don't bite the hand that feeds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm, I know that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got to go after him. He's not thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's stop him from making the biggest mistake of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:52.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's probably out there lost and cold, confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:21.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,One of us should wait here in case he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not now. This is an intervention. We all got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the fastest way to Grand Central?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You should take Lexington. - Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.89,0:18:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay. "We. " We should take Lexington. - What about Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Park goes two ways. You can't time the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard Tom Wolfe is speaking at Lincoln Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, of course we're going to throw poo at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:54.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should've taken Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure this is the fastest way to Grand Central Station?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:00.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know! That's what Melman said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:01.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,That room has some nifty little sinks you can wash up in, and look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Free mints!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:12.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is an urgent mission to save Marty from throwing his life away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, where's the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:22.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did Marty say to you? I asked you to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:26.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did! I did! I don't understand. He said, "Let's go. "
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:29.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said, "Are you crazy? " He says, "I'm ten years old. "
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:33.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he has black-and-white stripes, and so then we sang and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:42.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you got to do is go straight back down West 42nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's on your left after Vanderbilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you hit the Chrysler Building, you've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:53.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:55.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:58.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Did you say "zebra"? - That's right. A zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I shoot it? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:04.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to need some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Aw! Knicks lost again. - What are you going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:22.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did that say "Grand Central Station" or "my aunt's constipation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grand Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's grand and it's central.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:53.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move aside. We have an emergency here. This is an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Just chill out. It's not that big of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Upstairs, downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lady! What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:08.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow! Get a grip on yourselves, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a bad kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:15.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dagnabbit! I missed the express.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll have to take the Stamford local.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got him! I've got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:23.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got him! He's got him! He's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got something for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:29.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:32.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I am so glad we found you. - We were so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:39.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm fine, I'm fine. Look at me. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:43.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're fine? Oh, he's fine. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hear that? Marty's fine. That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:50.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to us? I thought we were your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal? I was coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:55.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't ever do this again. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you hear him? - Guys, we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Melman, you broke their clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:03.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,... do this again! Don't you ever, ever do this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:04.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've been ratted out, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.45,0:22:24.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cute and cuddly, boys. Cute and cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you have any poo, fling it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:34.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good evening, officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:40.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. No. You don't talk now. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:42.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not good with the "putting words together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:45.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,and their coming out good" thing. You keep it "shh. "
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:49.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! How you doing? You know what? Everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:53.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,We just had a little situation here. Little internal situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:56.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friend went a little crazy. Happens to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,The city gets to us all. Went a little cuckoo in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be calling me cuckoo in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:05.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just shush! I will handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.31,0:23:06.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:08.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go! Right here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you give a guy a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:16.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll take my little friend home and forget this ever happened. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:19.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,No harm, no foul, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's cool. It's me, Alex the lion. From the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:30.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:44.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel really, really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last night's dramatic incident in Grand Central
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:19.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,is an example of what animal rights wackos have been shouting for years:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:22.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Animals clearly don't belong in captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are to be sent back to their natural habitat,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:28.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,where they will live their lives in the freedom they desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.69,0:24:31.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey. Little help? - He's awake! He's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:35.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.21,0:24:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:53.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:56.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. Where? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.72,0:25:00.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm in a box! Oh, no. No, no! Not the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.69,0:25:03.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, they can't transfer me. Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.99,0:25:07.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't breathe. I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darkness creeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:11.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.73,0:25:13.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Walls closing in around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.24,0:25:17.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,So alone. So alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:20.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alex! Alex, are you there? - Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:23.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah! Talk to me, buddy. - Oh, Marty! You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:26.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's going on? You okay? - This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.75,0:25:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alex, Marty, is that you? - Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.75,0:25:31.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're here too! - I am loving the sound of your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.79,0:25:34.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is going on? - We're all in crates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:35.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sleeping just knocks me out. - Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.26,0:25:40.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that Melman?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.26,0:25:42.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? - Yeah. No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:46.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I often doze off while I'm getting an MRl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:48.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not getting an MRl. - CAT scan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,No CAT scan. It's a transfer. It's a zoo transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.77,0:25:55.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zoo transfer? ! Oh, no. No, no, I can't be transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.28,0:25:57.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have an appointment with Dr. Goldberg at 5:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.28,0:26:00.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are prescriptions that have to be filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:03.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,No other zoo could afford my medical care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.32,0:26:04.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I am not going HMO.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.29,0:26:07.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Melman. It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.79,0:26:12.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We are going to be okizay. - No, we're not going to be okizay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, because of you, we're ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:18.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because of me? I fail to see how this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.30,0:26:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're kidding, right, Marty? - You. You ticked off the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:24.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You bit the hand, Marty. You bit the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:28.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,"l don't know who I am. I got to go find myself in the wild. " Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:32.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did not ask you to come after me, did l?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,He does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:37.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - I did say we should stay at the zoo, but you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:38.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, just shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:40.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You suggested this idea to him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:43.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Leave Melman out of this. - Thank you, Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not my fault that we were transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:49.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, shut it. Does anybody feel nauseous?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.83,0:26:53.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I feel nauseous. - Melman, you always feel nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.39,0:27:00.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Progress report.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.39,0:27:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's an older code, skipper. I can't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.43,0:27:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, higher mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.93,0:27:07.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:10.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Phil can read, though. Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.27,0:27:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ship to Kenya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:20.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wildlife preserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.78,0:27:21.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Africa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.86,0:27:25.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Africa? That ain't going to fly. Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.63,0:28:10.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was the star in the greatest city on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:12.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Guys, listen. - A king. Loved by my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:15.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's be civil. - And you've ruined everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:16.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Loved"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:20.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,If the people loved you, it's only because they didn't know the real you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.17,0:28:24.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't make me come up there. I'll whoop both of y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.26,0:28:25.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I knew the real you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.85,0:28:30.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your black-and-white stripes, they cancel each other out. You're nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it, stop it, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:34.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not helping the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:36.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Status.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.36,0:28:39.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's no good. I don't know the codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:43.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't give me excuses. Give me results! Navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:51.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,And shut him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.17,0:28:57.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I did it! - Let's get this tin can turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.87,0:29:25.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:27.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:29.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.21,0:29:31.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.50,0:29:33.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.50,0:29:35.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty? !
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:39.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.89,0:29:42.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Come back, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.47,0:29:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:31.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.06,0:30:34.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:36.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:42.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.23,0:30:43.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.57,0:30:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:48.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.07,0:30:52.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman! Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:56.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, anyone! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.13,0:31:03.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty, Melman, Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:08.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria, Melman, Marty. Marty, Gelman, Gloria. Marty, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.14,0:31:10.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Morty, Morty, Gelman. Regis. Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.84,0:31:12.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Matt, Katie, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.23,0:31:20.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me out of this thing. Somebody. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:23.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me out of this thing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:25.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:27.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:29.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.53,0:31:33.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, I got you. Hang on! Hang on. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.62,0:31:41.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman! I got you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.88,0:31:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Melman. Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:52.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - I'm getting you out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.64,0:31:56.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Relax. - Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.47,0:32:00.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Giraffe, corner pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.14,0:32:02.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:04.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait, wait, wait, wait. - Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.57,0:32:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait, Alex. - Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.57,0:32:08.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, come on. - Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! Look! Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.62,0:32:13.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Gloria. It's Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it is Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:18.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:19.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:29.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.59,0:32:36.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, boys, fun's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.60,0:32:37.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.01,0:32:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:43.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Marty? ! - Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.94,0:32:47.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! All right! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.02,0:32:51.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Left! Left! Left. No, no, your left! Your left! Your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.61,0:32:58.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything on me right now. I'll have to get you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.67,0:33:04.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,To you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.04,0:33:09.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.63,0:33:13.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.14,0:33:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.10,0:33:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.72,0:33:21.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.14,0:33:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:26.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.03,0:33:28.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:32.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, sugar, honey, ice tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:33.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Martin!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.99,0:33:35.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hold up! - I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.49,0:33:38.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come here! Don't run away from me! - Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.49,0:33:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you keep running, I'm going to just kill you more!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.49,0:33:43.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.00,0:33:47.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all here together. Safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.50,0:33:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.50,0:33:53.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where exactly is "here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.49,0:34:08.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,San Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.19,0:34:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,San Diego?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.82,0:34:11.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,White sandy beaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.44,0:34:15.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,cleverly simulated natural environment, wide-open enclosures.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.56,0:34:18.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, this could be the San Diego Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.83,0:34:20.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Complete with fake rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.79,0:34:22.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, that looks real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:26.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,San Diego? What could be worse than San Diego?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:30.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. This place is crackalacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.46,0:34:33.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I could hang here. I could hang here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.25,0:34:34.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll kill you! - Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.21,0:34:36.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Strangle you! - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:39.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then bury you, dig you up, clone you and kill your clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:43.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- 20-second timeout. - I'll never talk to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.22,0:34:45.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, look. We're just going to find the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,get checked in and have this mess straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:53.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. This is just great. San Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:57.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I'll have to compete with Shamu and his smug little grin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.82,0:34:59.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't top that. Can't top it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.29,0:35:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm ruined! I'm done. I'm out of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:07.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, Marty! You've ruined me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.03,0:35:09.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Alex. Do you honestly think
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.00,0:35:11.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I intended all of this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:14.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want me to say that I'm sorry? Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.00,0:35:15.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, I'm... - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.42,0:35:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,He just shushed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:22.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Marty, look, you've got to be just a little bit more und... - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.81,0:35:26.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't you shush me. - Do you hear that? Don't you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.52,0:35:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I hear it now. - Where there's music, there's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:35.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go to the head honcho. - A sidewalk would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.23,0:35:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.78,0:35:38.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,They should call it the San Di-lame-o Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.78,0:35:43.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,First they tell you, "We got this great open plan thing. Let animals run wild. "
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:47.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next thing, flowers in your hair, everybody's hugging everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.84,0:35:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,This place kind of grows on you. This way, guys! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.01,0:36:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.36,0:36:11.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.57,0:36:21.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's make a good impression on the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.87,0:36:24.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smiles, everyone. Let's get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is that the best you can do? - Oh, I'm not smiling. It's gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:30.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, great. Let's make gas look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.25,0:36:40.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wow! - It's not people. It's animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.87,0:36:43.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,California animals. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:45.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is like a Puffy party.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:49.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like to move it, move it I like to move it, move it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:51.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ya like to - Move it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:55.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like to move it, move it I like to move it, move it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.40,0:36:57.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like to move it, move it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:58.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ya like to - Move it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:02.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like to move it, move it You like to move it, move it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.40,0:37:04.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,She like to move it, move it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:05.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He like to - Move it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.11,0:37:08.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,All girls all over the world
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Original King Julien 'pon yer case, man
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:15.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love how all the girls that love to move their body
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.24,0:37:17.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,When ya move your body, ya do
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.71,0:37:20.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move it nice and sweet and sassy, all right
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.96,0:37:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kind of zoo is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.55,0:37:25.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just saw 26 blatant health code violations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.55,0:37:28.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm loving San Diego. This place is off the chizain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:30.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:33.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woman, physically fit, physically fit
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:37.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Physically, physically, physically fit Physically fit, Physically fit
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.78,0:37:39.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should've brought chips and dip.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.82,0:37:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:44.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Alex? What happened to him? He was right behind us. Wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.91,0:37:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he's at, but he's missing one heck of a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.37,0:37:50.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fossa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.16,0:37:51.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fossa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:54.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fossa are attacking! Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.59,0:38:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fossa hungry. - Fossa eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate spiderwebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a lot, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.15,0:38:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting up. Really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.65,0:38:20.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hi. We just got in from New York, and we're looking for a supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.61,0:38:23.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because we've been sitting on that beach back there for hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.78,0:38:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,and nobody's even bothered to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.58,0:38:29.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know how things are normally run around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:32.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,but there's been some sort of major screwup, which is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.75,0:38:36.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,So if you could point us towards the administrative offices, we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:37.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, howdy-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.18,0:38:47.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spider! Spider! Spider on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.80,0:38:50.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maurice, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:53.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,He scared the fossa away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.44,0:38:56.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gloria. Get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.11,0:38:59.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it! Get it! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.36,0:39:01.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's it! Smack it! - Get it, get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.03,0:39:04.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whip it! Whip it good! Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.32,0:39:08.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,King Julien, what are they? What are they? !
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.57,0:39:13.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are aliens. Savage aliens from the savage future.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.63,0:39:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've come to kill us. And take our women. And our precious metals.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:22.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up, Mort. Do not be near the king's feet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.67,0:39:27.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're hiding. Be quiet, everyone. Including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.17,0:39:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's making that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.17,0:39:30.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.59,0:39:32.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,There it is! Get it! Come on, Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Enough! Enough with the stick. - I think she got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.18,0:39:38.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it still on me? I hate spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.18,0:39:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.02,0:39:43.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.61,0:39:44.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tonight we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.94,0:39:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,The feet. I told you... I told you to... I told every...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.06,0:39:49.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell him about the feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.70,0:39:53.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,He did tell you about the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:57.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait. I have a plan. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.84,0:39:59.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have devised a cunning test
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:03.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,to see whether these are savage killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.55,0:40:11.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.63,0:40:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You let me handle it. Alex handles it. Marty does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:21.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.73,0:40:28.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.23,0:40:32.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Alex, what'd you do? - Stop. Stop. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:35.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just a silly... Just a silly lion. Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.71,0:40:42.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Aw, Alex! - Oh, you poor little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:44.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did that big mean lion scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,He did? He's a big, bad old puddy tat, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:52.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Mama'll hold you. Aww, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.81,0:40:55.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are so cute from a reasonable distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:59.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the sweetest little thing. I just want to dunk him in my coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.68,0:41:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're just a bunch of pansies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.30,0:41:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.77,0:41:06.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's something about that one with the crazy hairdo
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.77,0:41:08.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,that I find suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:10.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nonsense, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.86,0:41:14.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody. Let's go and meet the pansies!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.51,0:41:29.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Presenting your royal highness, our illustrious King Julien Xlll,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.01,0:41:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,self-proclaimed lord of the lemurs, et cetera. Hooray, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.69,0:41:42.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got style.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.86,0:41:51.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is he, like, king of the guinea pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.54,0:41:55.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it's a squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.07,0:41:58.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome, giant pansies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.16,0:42:00.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please feel free to bask in my glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.16,0:42:03.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Definitely a squirrel. - Yep. Squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.66,0:42:08.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,We thank you with enormous gratitude for chasing away the fossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.05,0:42:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The "whossa"? - The fossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:14.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,They annoy us by trespassing, interrupting our parties
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.26,0:42:16.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- and ripping our limbs off. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.34,0:42:19.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're just trying to find out where the people are, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.10,0:42:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What big teeth you have. Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:25.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, Maurice. Can you not see that you have insulted the freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.43,0:42:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You must tell me, who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.02,0:42:33.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Alex. The Alex. And this is Gloria, Marty and Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.19,0:42:36.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,And just where are you giants from?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.53,0:42:38.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're from New York and...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.11,0:42:41.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,All hail the New York giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.45,0:42:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,New York giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.00,0:42:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of inbreeding program?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.09,0:42:51.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say we just got to ask these bozos where the people are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.59,0:42:54.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. We bozos have the people, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.51,0:42:58.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, the bozos have the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.08,0:43:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, great. Good. Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.64,0:43:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.39,0:43:10.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you love the people? Not a very lively bunch, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.90,0:43:11.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.20,0:43:14.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,So do you have any live people?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.62,0:43:17.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Only dead ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, if we had a lot of live people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:24.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be called the wild, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.29,0:43:25.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,The wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.79,0:43:28.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Hold up there a second, fuzzbucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:30.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:34.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,the "live in a mud hut, wipe yourself with a leaf" type wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who wipes? - Oy vey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.84,0:43:39.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oy vey! - Oy vey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.64,0:43:41.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oy vey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.64,0:43:44.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you excuse me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.43,0:43:51.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here! We got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.82,0:43:54.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Help! - What are you doing? !
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.44,0:43:56.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm swimming back to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.91,0:43:59.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know my chances are slim, but I have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.91,0:44:03.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't swim! - I said my chances are slim!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.42,0:44:08.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nature! It's all over me! Get it off! I can't see! I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.12,0:44:12.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.12,0:44:16.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. There's obviously just been a little mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.43,0:44:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,The people didn't dump us here on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.80,0:44:23.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,As soon as they realize what happened, they'll come looking for us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.22,0:44:24.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.22,0:44:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know the words But we're born free
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.64,0:44:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know something? I bet they're already on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:43.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, boys, it's going to be ice-cold sushi for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.12,0:44:47.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.05,0:44:54.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, since I'm doomed to die on this forsaken island,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.13,0:44:56.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, Melman Mankiewicz,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.64,0:45:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,being of sound mind and unsound body,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.14,0:45:04.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,have divided my estate equally among the three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.73,0:45:06.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.01,0:45:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! A latrine. Nice work, Melman. Outdoor plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.73,0:45:13.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's not a latrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.82,0:45:17.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a grave. You sent Melman to his grave. Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.86,0:45:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.44,0:45:22.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't the end. This is a whole new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.94,0:45:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,This could be the best that's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.28,0:45:27.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.37,0:45:31.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. No. No. No. No. This is not the best thing that's happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.87,0:45:35.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,You abused the power of the birthday wish and brought bad luck on all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.87,0:45:38.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why'd you tell your wish? You're not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:41.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to tell you. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You guys made me tell you. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.88,0:45:48.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, this isn't bad luck. This is good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:51.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look around. There's no fences, no schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.47,0:45:53.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,This place is beautiful. Baby, we were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.06,0:45:56.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay. I've had enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.64,0:46:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is your side of the island, and this is our side of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.65,0:46:04.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is the bad side, where you can prance and skip
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Iike a magical pixie horse and do whatever the heck you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.74,0:46:11.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the good side for those who love New York and care about going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.74,0:46:14.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. - No, no. Back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.71,0:46:16.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.66,0:46:20.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay! You all have your side, and I'll have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.79,0:46:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if you need me, I'll be over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.14,0:46:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,on the fun side of the island, having a good old time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.04,0:46:29.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the fun side,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.64,0:46:32.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,where we'll have a great time surviving until we go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.01,0:46:35.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A yabbadabbado old time! - This side's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.64,0:46:39.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,That side stinks! You're on the Jersey side of this cesspool!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.14,0:46:41.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wilma! - Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.61,0:46:44.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I have a plan to get us rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:50.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see the look on Marty's face when he sees this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:56.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just look at him. He's helpless without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.51,0:47:08.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Spalding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.56,0:47:16.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been standing here for hours, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.64,0:47:19.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long do I have to pose like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:22.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,She is finito.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.28,0:47:27.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I defy any rescue boat within a million miles
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.07,0:47:29.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,to miss this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.54,0:47:33.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the moment is right, we will ignite the beacon of liberty
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.58,0:47:37.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,and be rescued from this awful nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.46,0:47:40.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.63,0:47:43.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How's the liberty fire going, Melman? - Great. Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.72,0:47:45.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.17,0:47:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't we just borrow some of Marty's fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.01,0:47:53.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's wild fire. We're not using wild fire on Lady Liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.26,0:47:55.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now, rub, Melman. - I've been doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.85,0:48:00.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't. I can't. I can't do it. I ju... I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.85,0:48:02.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.36,0:48:05.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.03,0:48:09.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.11,0:48:14.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.92,0:48:16.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.08,0:48:17.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet! No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.59,0:48:21.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jump! Alex, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:26.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, cats always land on their...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.10,0:48:29.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Face? Man, what kind of cat are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:40.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.98,0:48:43.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You burned it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.19,0:48:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.28,0:48:48.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darn you all to heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.62,0:48:50.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we go to the fun side now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.20,0:48:55.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody, calm down. Come on. Into your chairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.24,0:48:58.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody, calm down. Let go of his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.29,0:49:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Separate those two, would you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.83,0:49:02.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You here, you there. Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.21,0:49:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calm down, people, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.22,0:49:10.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, presenting your royal highness, the illustrious blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.26,0:49:13.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, et cetera, et cetera. Hooray. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.73,0:49:15.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.23,0:49:19.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,we all have great curiosity about our guests, the New York giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.06,0:49:21.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, Willie? - I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:26.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like them. I liked them first. Before I even met them I liked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.27,0:49:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I liked them right away. You hate them compared to how much I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.11,0:49:32.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up. You're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.41,0:49:36.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, for as long as we can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.50,0:49:41.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,we have been attacked and eaten by the dreaded fossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.67,0:49:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fossa! The fossa are attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.71,0:49:50.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a cookbook! It's a cookbook!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.43,0:49:52.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.01,0:49:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.97,0:49:59.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, y'all. They're not attacking us this very instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:03.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,So my genius plan is this:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.78,0:50:06.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will make the New York giants
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.28,0:50:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,our friends and keep them close.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.28,0:50:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, with Mr. Alex protecting us,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.78,0:50:16.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,we will be safe and never have to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.29,0:50:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,about the dreaded fossa ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.49,0:50:26.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought of that. I thought of that. Yes. Me. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.20,0:50:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on, everybody. Hold on. I'm just thinking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.17,0:50:32.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, does anyone wonder why the fossa
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.17,0:50:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,were so scared of Mr. Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.89,0:50:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe we should be scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.26,0:50:41.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if Mr. Alex is even worse than the fossa?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.76,0:50:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tell you, that dude just gives me the heebiedabajeebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.89,0:50:48.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maurice, you did not raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.35,0:50:52.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Therefore, your heinous comment will be stricken from the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.11,0:50:56.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else have the heebie-jeebies?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:59.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,No? Good. So shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.50,0:51:02.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the New York giants wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.58,0:51:08.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,we will make sure that they wake up in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.59,0:51:11.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, who would like a cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.48,0:51:41.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, Al. Melman and Gloria are over there having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.49,0:51:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's room on the fun side for one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.03,0:51:45.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.99,0:51:50.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I've been thinking. Maybe if you gave this place a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.03,0:51:52.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, you might even enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.00,0:51:56.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty, I'm tired. I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.50,0:51:58.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.01,0:52:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you just give it a chance? Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.51,0:52:07.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,It really isn't the fun side without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.66,0:52:25.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.12,0:52:30.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's him. - Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:33.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the pizza man. Who the heck do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes? Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.46,0:52:38.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I come to the fun side?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.68,0:52:42.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.38,0:52:45.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I've been kind of a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.61,0:52:52.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I've been thinking about what you said, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.32,0:53:02.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Casa del Wild. Take a load off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:05.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wipe your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.16,0:53:14.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alex! - Mi casa is su casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.17,0:53:22.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.67,0:53:25.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, have a drink. It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.93,0:53:29.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.35,0:53:33.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't swallow it. It's just temporary till the plumbing's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.89,0:53:35.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, y'all look hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.74,0:53:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,How would you like some of nature's goodness?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.03,0:53:42.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have food?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.69,0:53:45.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Fun Side Special, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.33,0:53:48.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seaweed on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.45,0:53:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seaweed?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.25,0:53:53.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,On a stick. Don't love it till you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.01,0:54:02.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.97,0:54:06.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So good. - Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.43,0:54:09.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,It does kind of hit the spot, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.19,0:54:13.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it could use a little lemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.20,0:54:21.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's great. It's really great. Doesn't get any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.70,0:54:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.04,0:54:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.13,0:54:34.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. Would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.00,0:54:39.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like billions and billions of helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.50,0:54:41.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a shooting star. Make a wish. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.25,0:54:45.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh! How about a thick, juicy steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.47,0:54:47.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what, Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:51.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise you I'm going to find you a steak tomorrow if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.60,0:54:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:56.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is getting late. I guess I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.10,0:54:58.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to hit the sack too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.57,0:55:00.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.10,0:55:32.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.15,0:55:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.73,0:55:49.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty-seven, 28, 29. Thirty black and only 29 white.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.29,0:55:52.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're black with white stripes after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.29,0:55:53.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dilemma solved. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.50,0:56:08.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, Maurice, Mr. Alex was grooming his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.26,0:56:11.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,He is clearly a tender, loving thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.84,0:56:14.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you have the heebie-jeebies for Mr. Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.85,0:56:18.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at him. He's so cute and plushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.52,0:56:21.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think he was grooming him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:23.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look more like he was tasting him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.65,0:56:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself, no matter. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.31,0:56:30.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Soon we will put my excellent plan to action.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.28,0:56:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is wait
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.86,0:56:37.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,until they are deep in their sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.37,0:56:46.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long is this going to take? !
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.45,0:57:13.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.04,0:57:17.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mr. Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.04,0:57:21.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mr. Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.55,0:57:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rise and shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.05,0:57:27.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wakey-waking, Mr. Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.55,0:57:29.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.59,0:57:30.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You suck your thumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.84,0:57:36.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are we? What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.51,0:57:38.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the beach? Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.85,0:57:41.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who built a forest? - Don't be alarmed, giant freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.93,0:57:42.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,While you were asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.02,0:57:47.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,we simply took you to our little corner of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.44,0:57:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Madagascar.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.77,0:57:52.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mada-who-ah? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.36,0:57:54.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not whooha. Ascar.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.42,0:58:03.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.00,0:58:06.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like my mural back at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:10.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, fella, that is the real deal right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.05,0:58:13.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at that, that's not a bad view.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.13,0:58:17.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the thing that you were always looking at, but it's actually there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:20.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's the real version of... - How about once around the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get our blood pumping, lungs breathing this fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.14,0:58:25.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's with me? !
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.64,0:58:28.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Naw. I don't think I could... You're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.15,0:58:29.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Want to play around?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.90,0:58:33.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.40,0:58:34.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.90,0:58:36.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.40,0:58:39.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that! Hey, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Marty, I'm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.16,0:58:44.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm it. I'm it. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.63,0:58:47.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Alex, get in the groove.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.13,0:58:49.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.13,0:58:52.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,My blood sugar's real low. I just don't have the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.64,0:58:54.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.64,0:58:57.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,First of all, that's not how you run in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.18,0:58:59.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Put the rubber to the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.34,0:59:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just have to let out that inner lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:04.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now, who's the cat? - Marty, I really don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.98,0:59:08.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are, that's who. Come on! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.15,0:59:10.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it. Let's build up some steam! You the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.77,0:59:12.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's the cat? - You the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.74,0:59:14.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's the cat? - You the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.24,0:59:17.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's the cat? Who's the cat? Who's the cat? Who's the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.03,0:59:22.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's the cat? Who's the cat? Who's the cat? Who's the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:24.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.09,0:59:32.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.18,0:59:41.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're it. You're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.69,0:59:43.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't juke the cat. Cat's too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.72,0:59:52.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel like a mile-high pastrami on rye on the fly from the deli in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.36,0:59:56.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's go wild! - Now you're talking!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.37,1:00:05.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man! I feel different.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.88,1:00:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Noogie, noogie, noogie. Noogie, noogie, noogie!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.88,1:00:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kind of charged up or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.88,1:00:15.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Like you said, baby, it's... - Crackalacking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.89,1:00:20.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ain't that right, Melman? - Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.09,1:00:24.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.90,1:00:29.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, Maurice, Alex is now our friend and the fossas are nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.98,1:00:32.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,It could be said that my plan is working
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.52,1:00:35.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,in a very good working kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.24,1:00:39.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex. You got to try some of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.00,1:00:43.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel good. Feel like a king again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.08,1:00:45.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,King?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.28,1:00:47.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should see his act.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.87,1:00:51.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Alex, why don't you show him some of your act.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.37,1:00:54.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. No, I really don't think I could... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:57.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen. Primates of all ages.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.80,1:00:59.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,The wild proudly presents:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.93,1:01:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The king.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.47,1:01:04.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex the lion!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.27,1:01:06.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,E flat, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.98,1:01:18.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The king is in the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.78,1:01:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, if he is the king, then where is his crown? I've got a crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.44,1:01:25.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got a very nice one. And it's here on my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.91,1:01:27.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at it. Have I got it on?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.16,1:01:36.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do the roar, man. Do the roar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.34,1:01:44.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. I've never heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.46,1:01:46.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Go wild, man! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.51,1:01:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Break out the wave!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.51,1:02:18.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.51,1:02:20.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're biting my butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.18,1:02:25.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, I'm not. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.77,1:02:29.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did you do? - You just bit me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.94,1:02:32.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I didn't. Did l?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.19,1:02:33.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You kind of did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.77,1:02:35.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.70,1:02:38.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why'd you bite me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.78,1:02:41.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Man, it's because you are his dinner. - What? !
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.90,1:02:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me? - That's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.23,1:02:48.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come, come, Maurice. What is a simple bite on the buttocks among friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.82,1:02:50.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, give me a nibble.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.32,1:02:54.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,The party is over, Julien. Your brilliant plan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.46,1:02:56.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.30,1:02:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your friend here is what we call
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.71,1:03:01.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,a deluxe-model hunting and eating machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.39,1:03:03.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he eats steak...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,... which is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.84,1:03:08.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get out of here. - Okey-dokey, Maurice, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.96,1:03:10.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,The plan failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.93,1:03:14.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,All is lost! We're all doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.43,1:03:18.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fossas will come back and gobble us with their mouths because...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.97,1:03:21.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,... we are all steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.66,1:03:23.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm steak! Me, me, me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.61,1:03:25.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Alex cannot stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.91,1:03:30.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He belongs with his own kind on the fossa side of the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:32.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,By the power vested in me,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.28,1:03:35.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,by the law of the jungle, blah, blah, blah, blah...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.62,1:03:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.62,1:03:39.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? Come on, do I look like a steak to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.79,1:03:41.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.09,1:03:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, I told you I don't look like a... Wait. What you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.04,1:03:46.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.97,1:03:51.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's going savage. - Run for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.27,1:03:54.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.62,1:04:15.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,A bull's eye. Excellent shot, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.71,1:04:16.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.30,1:04:23.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.80,1:04:27.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.43,1:04:34.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:37.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.43,1:04:39.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.43,1:04:40.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.93,1:04:44.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's true. I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.44,1:04:46.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.82,1:07:01.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What have I done? This is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.33,1:07:03.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,And it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.21,1:07:06.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, because of me, we've lost Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.21,1:07:07.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.80,1:07:10.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll find a way to help him. That's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.80,1:07:11.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.80,1:07:14.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, we are New Yorkers, right? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.42,1:07:16.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're tough. We're gritty. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.89,1:07:18.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're adaptable! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.73,1:07:21.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we are not going to lay down like a bunch of Melmans.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.73,1:07:24.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.26,1:07:25.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.35,1:07:28.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was not me, okay? That was the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.74,1:07:30.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The boat! - The boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.82,1:07:34.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,The boat's come back for us! Come on, guys, we got to flag it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.19,1:07:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.20,1:07:40.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, over here! - Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.20,1:07:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.83,1:07:44.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, give me a lift. Hurry up! Lift me up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.45,1:07:45.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.04,1:07:48.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my neck. My neck. You guys. - Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.62,1:07:52.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Melman! Steady. This way! - You have no idea how much this hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:54.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, boat! We're over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.93,1:08:01.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! It's turning! It's coming back! It's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.05,1:08:03.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.39,1:08:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! You guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.22,1:08:08.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You flag down that boat. I'll get Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.61,1:08:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hold on there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You cannot go back there by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.98,1:08:16.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on. I know Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.07,1:08:18.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,He hears we're rescued, he'll snap right out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.24,1:08:21.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,The people are coming. They can help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.82,1:08:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman's right. The people will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.83,1:08:27.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, we got to flag down that boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.18,1:08:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.15,1:08:51.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You? ! Oh, ma... Where are the people?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.60,1:08:53.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We killed them and ate their livers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.61,1:08:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got you, didn't l?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.66,1:08:59.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just kidding, doll, the people are fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.19,1:09:02.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're on a slow lifeboat to China.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:05.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.20,1:09:09.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's that psychotic lion and our monochromatic friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.00,1:09:13.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty? He's righ... Where did he go? He was right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.71,1:09:17.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,He went back for Alex. He's going to get himself killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.68,1:09:20.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, boys, our monochromatic friend's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.80,1:09:22.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.88,1:09:25.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain's log: Embarking into hostile environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.47,1:09:29.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kowalski. We'll need to win the hearts and the minds of the natives.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.47,1:09:31.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico. We'll need special tactical equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.98,1:09:34.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going to face extreme peril.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.51,1:09:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Private probably won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.79,1:09:46.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Come out, Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.79,1:09:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,The boat's here! We can go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.67,1:10:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Alex! Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Alex! Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.18,1:10:09.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.18,1:10:12.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.93,1:10:14.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.27,1:10:17.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.07,1:10:20.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.77,1:10:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Alex. The boat came back. We can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.36,1:10:28.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can go back to civilization, and everything will be like it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.75,1:10:30.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.33,1:10:32.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.34,1:10:35.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.51,1:10:38.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex, you're no monster. You're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.63,1:10:41.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're a team. You and me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.85,1:10:51.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.14,1:11:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:27.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't leaving without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.11,1:11:46.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex? I'm thinking of a song.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.19,1:11:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful song. I'm sure you're familiar with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.83,1:11:55.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Start spreadin' the news
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.84,1:12:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving today
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.29,1:12:04.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are a great big part of it
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.88,1:12:11.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know the words. Two little words.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.14,1:12:14.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me sing this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.72,1:12:17.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to hear me sing this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.70,1:12:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, Alex? Could you come out here for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.45,1:12:28.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Alex, a little help.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.54,1:12:30.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.04,1:12:34.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.46,1:12:42.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me! Anybody, help me! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.93,1:12:58.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Melman? - That's right, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.73,1:13:01.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.65,1:13:05.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's the plan? - This is the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.94,1:13:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fossa hungry. - Fossa eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.53,1:13:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.61,1:13:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa halt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.61,1:13:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.95,1:13:18.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa aaahh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.17,1:13:22.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.96,1:13:26.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa aaahh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.93,1:13:28.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.13,1:13:30.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:44.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take that. - Fossa ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.86,1:13:47.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's too many of them, skipper.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.45,1:13:50.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been a real pleasure serving with you boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.74,1:13:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.63,1:14:00.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.13,1:14:01.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.97,1:14:08.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.25,1:14:11.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.66,1:14:29.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.11,1:14:33.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks for not giving up on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.61,1:14:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, you almost gave me a heart attack. You can't just come sneak up on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.67,1:14:41.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just because you're a lion... Let go of me. Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.86,1:14:44.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here. Guys, just go with me on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.09,1:14:47.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like I said, it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.96,1:14:50.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.51,1:14:52.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,My kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.60,1:14:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're all mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.35,1:15:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the king of the beasts! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.44,1:15:02.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't eat me! - He's big and scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.44,1:15:05.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fear me! Savagery beyond comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.89,1:15:09.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I am far too young to die! - You're a monster! A monster, I say!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:12.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And, you! - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.62,1:15:21.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want some of this? Ooh! You better run for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.54,1:15:24.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Somebody call a cop! - He's psychotic!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.92,1:15:34.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is my territory. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.39,1:15:39.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never, ever want to see you on my turf again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.48,1:15:47.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.49,1:15:52.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You the cat!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.86,1:15:55.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got my boy back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.58,1:15:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me some love! The plan worked! The plan worked! I'm very clever!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.37,1:16:05.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the one, baby! Come on. Time to robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.79,1:16:07.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am very clever king.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.79,1:16:10.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am super genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.29,1:16:12.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am robot king of the monkey things.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.04,1:16:16.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Compute, compute. - So, what's for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.80,1:16:20.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Close those eyes. - Why do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.88,1:16:22.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do it. - They're closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.39,1:16:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tighter. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.39,1:16:26.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No peeking. - They're closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.19,1:16:27.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.78,1:16:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hai.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.36,1:16:35.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open that hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.45,1:16:38.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire in the hole. Now chew.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.07,1:16:42.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Chew like you mean it. Savor it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.49,1:16:45.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And? - Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.25,1:16:46.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.08,1:16:49.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's always Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.05,1:16:52.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is better than steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love it. I love it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.05,1:16:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,The kitty loves the fishy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.89,1:17:02.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.09,1:17:05.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, he may be a pain in the butt at times...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.09,1:17:07.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,And trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.60,1:17:10.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,But this cat proved to me without a doubt
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.13,1:17:12.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,that his heart is bigger than his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.85,1:17:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- To Alex. - To Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.86,1:17:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.33,1:17:28.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Should we head back to New York?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.53,1:17:31.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I mean, this is your dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.12,1:17:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.17,1:17:35.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.21,1:17:38.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together, it doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.33,1:17:39.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.35,1:17:43.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo. Rico. I'll take 300 orders to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.38,1:17:44.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hai.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.85,1:17:48.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,But before you leave, I have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.72,1:17:51.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,So shut up, everyone, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.81,1:17:56.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,After much deep and profound brain things inside my head,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.40,1:17:58.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have decided to thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.45,1:18:01.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,for bringing peace to our home.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.45,1:18:03.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,And to make you feel good,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.45,1:18:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you this lovely parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.16,1:18:08.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I couldn't. Really, I can't take your crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.16,1:18:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's okay, I've got a bigger crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.74,1:18:12.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's got a gecko on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.75,1:18:15.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at him shake. Go, Stevie, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.38,1:18:19.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye, little fuzzbuckets! - Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.00,1:18:21.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So long! - Bye-bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.47,1:18:23.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Arrivederci. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.47,1:18:26.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Toodle-oo! - See you later, crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.06,1:18:29.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maurice, my arm is tired. Wave it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.06,1:18:32.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Faster, you naughty little monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.48,1:18:35.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,By the time we get back to New York, it'll be the middle of winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.60,1:18:37.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I was just thinking, why rush?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.07,1:18:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could make a few side stops along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.07,1:18:43.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe Paris. - You just read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.58,1:18:46.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking Spain. Run with the bulls.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.08,1:18:48.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about Fiji? - Canada. Can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.62,1:18:50.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cheap meds.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.58,1:18:53.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even mind coming back here sometime.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.59,1:18:55.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I could do that. - You could say that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.01,1:18:58.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Skipper? - I always wanted to go to Australia.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.79,1:19:02.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should tell them that the boat's out of gas?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.33,1:19:03.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.80,1:19:07.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just smile and wave, boys. Smile and wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,《马达加斯加》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,惊喜吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 我做白日梦的时候不要打扰我!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,当斑马在动物园里时 别理他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 只是想祝你生日快乐!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:33.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿伙计 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我塞牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:41.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,真难受! 你能帮帮我吗? 拜托?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来对地方了 我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂医生时刻准备着!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,请跳上我已经消毒的检查台 如果你还能行的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:56.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我什么也没看到 - 在左边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:57.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 别张嘴讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:04.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里 这个东西在里面干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,生日快乐!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,它在牙后面 你没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没有上市呢 这个 看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看看那个 看看 - 看看 在下雪哟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,十年了 哈? 十年!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:25.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,两位数 1-0
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 礼物很棒! - 你不喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该给你亚里克斯闹钟就好了 就是那个卖得更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 礼物很棒 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是一年又一年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我仍然重复着同样的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,"站在这 站在那 吃点草 再走回来"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我了解你的问题 - 也许我应该去上法学院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:53.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是需要从那乏味的日常生活中解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办? - 不要老一套
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,冲破禁锢 谁知道你要干什么呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:03:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,现编现演! 增加一些临时的即兴表演!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:03.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 你知道 保持新鲜感!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,新鲜感? 好 我可以做些不同的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我有用哟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,参观的人来了马蒂 哦 我爱人群!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,是娱乐者的娱乐时间了!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点格洛瑞尔! 上下然后张嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天星期几?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,星期五 郊游日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:28.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 今天是郊游日 快 起来开工啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,再多睡10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 梅尔曼 梅尔曼! 梅尔曼 梅尔曼 梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:40.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒! 太阳晒屁股啦! 又一个美好的纽约清晨!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,快起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不觉得 我病了 - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:49.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肩膀上发现又一块褐斑 就在这 你看见了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,看? 就在那! 你看见了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 你知道这都是你幻想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走! 快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:11.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,菲尔 醒醒 你这个滑稽的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦我要保持新鲜感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:21.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,直截了当 尝试新鲜 新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,斑马的新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 各位小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,中央动物园骄傲地介绍:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他们看那狮子! 谁是狮子?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,狮子亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,演出时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,咆哮!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:59.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家聚一聚 重大表演要开始了!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看斑马的加农炮 没错!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:39.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,微笑着招手 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,微笑着招手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,科娃斯基 任务报告
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们离公园主干线还有500英尺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:49.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 坏消息呢? - 我们最后一把铲子折了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:50.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,里科 你负责侦查 我们需要铲子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,和更多棒棒糖棍 我们不能再重新挖一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我呢 船长?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你看上去可爱讨喜 二等兵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我们要离开这水坝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,到这儿来 过来这里 来 小企鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶! 你没在动物星球看过这样的表演吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈-哈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:21.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,表演结束了! 感谢光临!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你们觉得新鲜!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我整个星期都在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上我一生中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一年365天我都在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:34.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括圣诞 万圣节!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了阉割你们的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:42.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有给出租司机小费 因为他破产了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 黑白的家伙 会说英语吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么国家? - 曼哈顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死! 我们还在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务取消 下潜 下潜 下潜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:04.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 穿晚礼服的家伙! 等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要挖去南极洲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,南什么州?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能保密吗 我的色盲朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前见过企鹅随便在纽约溜达吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:27.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然没有 我们不属于这里 这里不是大自然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都是一些怪人的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:34.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要去南极洲的广阔空间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,去野外!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,野外? 你们真的能到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:42.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,听上去不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 等等! 那是什么地方? 告诉我那是什么地方!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么也没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,是 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 没看到 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约市之王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,狮子亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,咆哮!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢! 非常感谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真好 给我点什么 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:20.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢! 哦 谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦! 很好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你们太好人了 你们真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,内裤!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:31.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,平安到家 嘿! 去我的网站看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,24小时开着的亚里克斯摄像头 可以看我睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是生活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我身处天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 今天是马蒂的生日! - 拆开 拆开吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么? 这是什么? - 快点 拆开! 你收到什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:05.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶! 体温计!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我喜欢 梅尔曼 我喜欢!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:15.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 我想给你些私人的东西 你知道这是我第一支直肠体温计
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈呀 呸 呸 呸 - 我会想念那个坏孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:18.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 把蛋糕拿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,生日快乐!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你住在动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看上去像只猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,闻起来也像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:39.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不错 你们真让我难为情!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你们自己!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么? 我们准备了一个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:46.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 许个愿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快点 你许了什么愿? - 不 不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 说!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,没戏 我告诉了你们就会被诅咒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想走霉运? 那我就说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果你们想没事的话 我就什么都不说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 马蒂你能告诉我们吗? 我说真的 说了又会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:12.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望我能去野外!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,野外! 哇哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你们说了会走霉运的!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,野外? 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我听过的最糟的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样很不卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:33.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,企鹅能去 为什么我不能?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,企鹅是神经病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,想想重回自然的怀抱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到你的老家 清新的空气 广阔的天地!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:44.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯我听说康涅狄格就很空旷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:47.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 康涅狄格? - 对 你要做的就是穿过中央车站
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后上一辆北上的列车 是北吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:55.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以可以搭车过去? 只是想想罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:58.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 行了! 康涅狄格能给我们什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 狮子的疾病 - 谢谢 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 真的我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,野外你肯定不会有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:07.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这精致的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,野外不可能找得到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没有想过生命和肉排之外的东西吗 亚里克斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:15.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不是那个意思 宝贝 不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:19.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们对动物园外的世界一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:21.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不觉得难过吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:28.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我是说 这只是个小事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你嘴边有点脏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你们帮我庆祝 很棒!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么让他无精打采?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你该跟他谈谈 亚里克斯 你过去安慰安慰他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:59.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 我已经给了他水晶球了 我还能做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯 - 我看你们也无计可施了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,很晚了 我想我要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 他是你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:25.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 马蒂! - 晚安 格洛瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天过得真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:54.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 真的我告诉你 不会比现在更好了 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:58.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的! 连星星都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:02.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜野外找不到这样的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,直升机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 伙计 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:13.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都会想别处的草比这里的绿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:14.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:20.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经10岁了 过了半辈子了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我甚至不知道我是黑底白条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是白底黑条的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想起一首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯 拜托 不是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:42.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是 是首好歌 我想你很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢不!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不听
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,开始广布消息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我将离开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:14:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们组成了家 - 这家伙真搞笑 他是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 你知道 你知道那个词
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个小小的字
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴! 闭嘴! 我在睡觉!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:14.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可不全是你们所知道的海龟!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:17.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也没给你特权 朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 你不用跑 你这斑马!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:22.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你惹他 你就是惹我 胆小鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你这头大嘴狮 - 看见了? 坏脾气的斑马先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是一个伟大的团队 我们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 毋庸置疑!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:35.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你还想干什么? 独自跑到野外去?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我! 我们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:38.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 野外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我一起!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,有条小路从第五大道到中央车站
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们爬上一列火车 一直向北!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:49.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们早上就能回来 没人会知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说笑的 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,对! 我说笑的 当然是开玩笑! 别逗了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想我们怎么搭火车?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后别再那样了 你刚才弄得我很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:09.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我想我该睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:13.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我也是 为了明天得好好休息嗓子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天大孩子来 我得叫得更大声些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:19.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他们点颜色看看! 你知道我在说什么吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们又忘了关音响!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的小肉排
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的边上有点肥肉的菲利牛排
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢 我喜欢边上有点肥肉的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的香甜多汁的牛排 真是极品美味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯 亚里克斯 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你吮拇指?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:35.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 梅尔曼?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:38.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 你知道我膀胱发炎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,每两个小时就要起夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:44.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去方便的时候 看了看马蒂的床 我一般不会如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么这次我看了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了梅尔曼 出什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,是马蒂 他不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不见了? 你什么意思 不见了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:55.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,他挖这个多久了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,那洞他进不去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:02.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂? 马蒂! 马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,真没道理 他会去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 康涅狄格! - 他不会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢不! 我们该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:15.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该 应该找人!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈喽? 给我接走失动物中心! 快!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有头斑马不见了 可能现在在去康涅狄格的路上 我们需要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? 喂? - 等会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不能找人 - 谁在 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会非常生气!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后把马蒂永远送走! 你不能恩将仇报
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,恩哼 那是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得去追他 他头脑不清
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要阻止他 犯下生命中最大的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:52.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很有可能迷路了 饥寒交迫不知所措
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:21.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该有个人等在这里 万一他回来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢不 不是现在 这事我们一定得管 梅尔曼 我们都要去!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么去中央车站最快?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你应该走莱克星敦街 - 梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.89,0:18:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 "我们" 我们应该走莱克星敦街 - 那帕克街呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好 帕克街是双向 红绿灯多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说汤姆伍尔夫在林肯中心演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们当然要去闹场子啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:54.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道我们应该走帕克街
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定这是去中央车站最快的路?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 是梅尔曼说的!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:01.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个房间让你可以洗 还有 看!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,免费薄荷糖!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不是来郊游
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,是来救马蒂于水深火热的紧急任务!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,车在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊! 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂对你说了什么? 我让你和他谈谈!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:26.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我谈了! 我谈了! 我不明白! 他说:我们走!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:29.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说:你疯了吗? 接着他说:我已经10岁了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:33.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后是他有黑白条纹 再然后我们就一起唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:42.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是直走到西42街
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你左手边范德大楼后面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你到了克莱斯勒大楼 就是走过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:53.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 等着信号灯!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:55.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:58.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是说"斑马"吗? - 对 没错 斑马
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在我面前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能开枪吗? - 别开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:04.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我需要支援
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢! 尼克斯队又输了一场 - 那又怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,广播说的是"中央车站"还是"我阿姨便秘"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这里了!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,中央车站!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,很大而且在中央
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:53.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,让一下 我们有紧急情况 这是紧急情况!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 冷静! 不是那么严重的紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我上 我下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,再试试这个滋味如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士 你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,管好你的人!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这只坏家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:15.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死 我错过了快车!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,似乎只能坐去斯坦福的慢车了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓到他了! 我抓到他了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,他抓到他了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:23.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他抓到他了! 他抓到他了! 他抓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也有好东西给你!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:29.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:32.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 你们来干吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我们很高兴找到了你 - 我们很担心你!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:39.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 我很好 我很好 你们看 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很好? 哦 他很好! 哦 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你听见了 马蒂很好 这样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我刚刚在想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:50.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么对我们 马蒂? 我以为我们是你的朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没什么大不了的! 我早上就回来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:55.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后不许了 听见没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听见没有? - 伙计们 我们没时间了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 梅尔曼 你弄坏了他们的钟?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许了! 以后再也再也不许了!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:04.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,用力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.45,0:22:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,可爱讨喜点 小家伙们 扮可爱点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你有什么招示 赶快使出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:34.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上好 长官!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:40.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 你别说话 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:42.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不擅长言表
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:45.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你闭嘴就好!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:49.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 你们好吗? 这里一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是出了点小状况 内部的小状况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上我朋友有点疯过头了 每个人都会这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:59.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是脑筋搭错了线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 别说我搭错了线!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:05.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,别说话! 我来解决!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.31,0:23:06.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我踢到他了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:08.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,快快快! 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能不这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:16.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们准备把我们的朋友带回去 忘记发生过的一切 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有伤害和子弹 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不 嘿 冷静! 是我 亚里克斯 动物园的狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:30.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:44.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇哦! 我感觉好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我非常爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨晚在中央车站的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,是多年来呼吁动物权利的一个例子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,动物很显然不该被囚禁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在他们要被送回到自然的生活环境中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:28.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那里他们可以自由自在 地过他们渴望的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.69,0:24:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 帮帮忙 - 他醒了! 他醒了!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,快想办法!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:35.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.21,0:24:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我的头!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么破 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:56.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里? 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.72,0:25:00.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在箱子里! 噢不! 不不! 不要箱子!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.69,0:25:03.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢不 他们不能送我走! 不是我!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.99,0:25:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能呼吸了 我不能呼吸了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,黑暗袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:11.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能呼吸了 我不能呼吸!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.73,0:25:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,墙向我缩进!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.24,0:25:17.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好孤独 好孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:20.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯 你在那吗? - 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:23.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对! 跟我说话! - 哦 马蒂! 你在这!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:26.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了? 你还好吗? - 不太好 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.75,0:25:28.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯 马蒂 是你们吗 - 格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.75,0:25:31.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你也在! - 我爱死了你的声音!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.79,0:25:34.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了? - 我们在箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:35.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我睡得昏昏沉沉的 - 梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.26,0:25:40.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是梅尔曼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.26,0:25:42.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:46.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做完核磁共振检查后总是会昏昏沉沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:48.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没有做核磁共振检查 - 切片扫描?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是切片扫描? 是转园! 转园!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.77,0:25:55.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,转园? ! 哦 不 不 不 我不要转园
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.28,0:25:57.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和戈德堡医生5点有约
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.28,0:26:00.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的药吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有别的动物园能给我如此的医疗照顾!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.32,0:26:04.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我哪也不去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.29,0:26:07.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事梅尔曼 一切都会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.79,0:26:12.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们会没事的 - 不马蒂 我们不会没事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在因为你我们都毁了!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:18.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我? 我倒想看看怎么是我的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.30,0:26:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑的 是不是马蒂? - "你! 你把我们都惹火了"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:24.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你恩将仇报 马蒂 你恩将仇报
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,"我不知道我是谁 我不知道我是谁 我要在野外找到自我"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 我没有让你们来找我 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 我说过我们应该待在动物园里 但你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:38.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 闭嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:40.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你第一个出的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:43.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯 别把梅尔曼扯进来 - 谢谢 格洛瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有亚里克斯 我们被转园不是我的错!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:49.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 闭嘴 你们谁觉得恶心?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.83,0:26:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得 - 梅尔曼 你总是觉得恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.39,0:27:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,进度报告
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.39,0:27:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是旧式编码 船长 我不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.43,0:27:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 高级哺乳动物
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.93,0:27:07.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你识字吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:10.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不认 但是菲尔认字 菲尔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.27,0:27:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,运往肯尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:20.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,野生动物保护区
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.78,0:27:21.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.86,0:27:25.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,非洲 那可不行 里科!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.63,0:28:10.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾是世上最伟大城市里的大明星!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:12.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 听着 - 被人热爱的国王!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:15.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我们文明一点 - 你毁了一切!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:16.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,"爱"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:20.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果人们爱你 那只是因为他们不认识真正的你!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.17,0:28:24.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我上去 胖揍你们俩一顿!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.26,0:28:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为我了解真正的你!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.85,0:28:30.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你个黑白条纹的 他们在你之后取消了一切权利!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,停! 停! 停! 停!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:34.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 你们要有耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:36.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,状态
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.36,0:28:39.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况不妙 我不知道密码!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:43.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要借口! 给我结果! 导航!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:51.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他闭嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.17,0:28:57.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我成功了! - 让我们把船掉头!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.87,0:29:25.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:27.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:29.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.21,0:29:31.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.50,0:29:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.50,0:29:35.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂? !
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:39.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.89,0:29:42.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不! 等等! 回来 马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.47,0:29:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:31.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.06,0:30:34.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:36.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:42.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.23,0:30:43.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.57,0:30:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔? !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:48.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.07,0:30:52.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼! 格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿有人吗? 哈喽!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.13,0:31:03.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 梅尔曼 格洛瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:08.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔 梅尔曼 马蒂 马蒂 吉尔曼 格洛瑞尔 马蒂 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.14,0:31:10.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫蒂 莫蒂 吉尔曼 丽贾斯 凯利
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.84,0:31:12.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,马特 凯特 艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.23,0:31:20.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我出去 有人吗! 哈喽?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上让我出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈喽? 有人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:29.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯? 是你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.53,0:31:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 我找到你了! 坚持 坚持 我找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.62,0:31:41.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼! 我找到你了 伙计!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.88,0:31:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,等会儿 梅尔曼 等着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:52.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯 你在干吗? - 把你弄出来!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.64,0:31:56.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放松 - 亚里克斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.47,0:32:00.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,长颈鹿 四分位!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.14,0:32:02.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯来啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等! 等等! 别! 等等! - 别动!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.57,0:32:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 亚里克斯 - 别动
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.57,0:32:08.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不! 别! - 我来啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,看! 看! 看! 看!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.62,0:32:13.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,是格洛瑞尔! 是格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦嘿 是格洛瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:18.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:29.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.59,0:32:36.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了伙计们 娱乐结束
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.60,0:32:37.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.01,0:32:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:43.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂? ! - 马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.94,0:32:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘢! 对! 就这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.02,0:32:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,左边! 左边! 左边 不 不对 是你的左边! 你的左边! 你的左边!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在这儿下就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.61,0:32:58.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在什么都没有 以后再给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.67,0:33:04.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.04,0:33:09.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.63,0:33:13.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.14,0:33:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.10,0:33:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.72,0:33:21.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.14,0:33:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:26.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.03,0:33:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:32.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 糖 蜂蜜 冰茶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.99,0:33:35.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等! - 我要杀了你!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.49,0:33:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你给我过来! 不许再跑! - 冷静点!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.49,0:33:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你再跑 我就用更厉害的招示来对付你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.49,0:33:43.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 看看我们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.00,0:33:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在一起 毫发无伤
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.50,0:33:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我们在这
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.50,0:33:53.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,"这"到底是什么地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.49,0:34:08.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,圣地亚哥
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.19,0:34:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,圣地亚哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.82,0:34:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,白沙海岸
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.44,0:34:15.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,精致的模拟自然环境 宽广的场地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.56,0:34:18.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉你这可能是圣地亚哥动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.83,0:34:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全仿造的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.79,0:34:22.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 看上去很真实
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:26.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,圣地亚哥? 还有什么比圣地亚哥更糟的?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 这个地方很棒 我喜欢!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.46,0:34:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我可以留在这 我可以留在这
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.25,0:34:34.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 马蒂! - 放松! 放松!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.21,0:34:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 然后勒死你! - 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:39.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后埋了你 再把你挖出来 然后克隆你! 再把所有克隆的你都杀了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:43.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 20秒的暂停! - 我再也不理你了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.22,0:34:45.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了! 听着 我们得先找到人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,向他们报到 然后结束这出闹剧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:53.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 好呀 这真是太好了 圣地亚哥
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得去和杀人鲸竞争 那些得意地咧着嘴笑的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.82,0:34:59.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我比不过他们 我赢不了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.29,0:35:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我完了! 我彻底完蛋了 我失业了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都是你的错 马蒂! 你把我给毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.03,0:35:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 亚里克斯 你好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.00,0:35:11.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在这样全都是我的错吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:14.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是想我给你道歉吗? 这就是你想要的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.00,0:35:15.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那好 对不 - 嘘!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.42,0:35:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,他嘘我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:22.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 你看 你应该多理解别人... - 嘘!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.81,0:35:26.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是在嘘我吗? - 你们听到吗? 你们都没听到那声音吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.52,0:35:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我现在听到了 - 有音乐的地方就有人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:35.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们直接去找老板 - 要有人行道就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.23,0:35:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 这地方真差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.78,0:35:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们应该叫这里圣地残哥动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.78,0:35:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先他们告诉你:"我们有个超棒的开放计划 让所有动物都到野外去尽情狂奔"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:47.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就有人扔花 大家相互拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.84,0:35:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是个令人喜欢的地方 伙计们 在这边! 快来!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.01,0:36:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.36,0:36:11.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.57,0:36:21.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 让我们给这些人留个不错的第一印象
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.87,0:36:24.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,笑起来 然后一块儿出去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼 这就是你最灿烂的笑容吗? - 哦 我没笑 是想放屁
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:30.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 让我们放屁也放得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.25,0:36:40.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 这不是人类 还是动物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.87,0:36:43.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,加洲的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:45.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就象是帕妃的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:49.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢跳舞 跳舞 我喜欢跳舞 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢 - 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:55.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢跳舞 跳舞 我喜欢跳舞 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.40,0:36:57.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢跳舞 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢 - 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:02.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢跳舞 跳舞 你喜欢跳舞 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.40,0:37:04.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她喜欢跳舞 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:05.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他喜欢 - 跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.11,0:37:08.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,世上所有的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是国王朱利安
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:15.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱所有爱跳舞的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.24,0:37:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你想跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.71,0:37:20.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就漂亮地舞 尽情地舞 热情地舞 舞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.96,0:37:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个什么样的动物园啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.55,0:37:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚刚看到有26条健康准则被违反
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.55,0:37:28.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱圣地亚哥 这地方实在太炫了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:30.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,27条
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:33.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,女人 苗条 苗条
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,苗条 苗条 苗条 苗条 苗条
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.78,0:37:39.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该带着薯片来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.82,0:37:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:44.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯在哪里? 他怎么了? 他刚刚就在我们后面的 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.91,0:37:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道他去哪里了 反正他错过了派对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.37,0:37:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.16,0:37:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:54.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼入侵啦! 快逃命啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.59,0:38:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伏狼饿了 - 伏狼有东西吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌蜘蛛网
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 伙计们 谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.15,0:38:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们等我 实在很感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.65,0:38:20.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 你们好 我们刚从纽约过来 我们想见负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.61,0:38:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们已经在沙滩上坐了几个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.78,0:38:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没有任何人来接待我们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.58,0:38:29.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道这里的规矩是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:32.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过有些事情显然没安排好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.75,0:38:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以如果你们可以告诉我们管理人员的办公室在哪里 那我们就
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:37.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.18,0:38:47.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 蜘蛛! 蜘蛛! 我背上有蜘蛛!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.80,0:38:50.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫里斯 你看到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:53.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,他把伏狼吓跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.44,0:38:56.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,快 格洛瑞尔 打他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.11,0:38:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,打他! 打他! 打他!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.36,0:39:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他在这! 快打他! - 快打 打!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.03,0:39:04.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,扁他! 扁他! 他去哪儿了?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.32,0:39:08.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,朱利安 国王陛下 他们是什么东西? 他们是什么啊? !
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.57,0:39:13.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是外星人 从未开化的未来来的野蛮外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.63,0:39:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来屠杀我们 掠走我们的妇女 抢夺我们珍贵的金属
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:22.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,起来 小姑娘 离国王的脚远点 明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.67,0:39:27.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘘 我们在躲难 所有的人 连我在内 都要保持安静
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.17,0:39:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁发出声音了?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.17,0:39:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 又是我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.59,0:39:32.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在这儿! 揍他! 快 格洛瑞尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 够了! 别再用棍子打了 - 我想她打着了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.18,0:39:38.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还在我身上吗? 我讨厌蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.18,0:39:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.02,0:39:43.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是野人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.61,0:39:44.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们活不过今晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.94,0:39:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脚! 我告诉过你 我说过 我告诉过每个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.06,0:39:49.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没告诉过他离我的脚远点吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.70,0:39:53.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他确实告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:57.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 我有个计划 - 真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.84,0:39:59.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想出了一个绝妙的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:03.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试看他们是不是凶残的杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.55,0:40:11.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.63,0:40:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来处理 亚里克斯处理事情 马蒂什么也别管
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:21.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.73,0:40:28.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.23,0:40:32.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 亚里克斯 你都干了些什么? - 别哭 别哭 没事的 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:35.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是头苯苯的 只是头笨笨的狮子 哦 天哪!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.71,0:40:42.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 亚里克斯! - 哦 可怜的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:44.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是这讨厌的大狮子吓到你了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,吓着你了么? 他是个大大的坏小孩 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:52.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来 妈妈抱抱 哦 看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.81,0:40:55.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,从某种意义上他们非常可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:59.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个小可爱 我真想把它加进我的咖啡里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.68,0:41:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只是一群小白脸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.30,0:41:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.77,0:41:06.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得那个梳着爆炸头的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.77,0:41:08.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:10.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡说 莫里斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.86,0:41:14.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 大家! 我们去见见小白脸们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.51,0:41:29.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,尊敬的陛下 杰出的国王朱利安13世
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.01,0:41:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,狐猴之王 等等 等等 自己宣布驾到 欢呼万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.69,0:41:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他真有形
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.86,0:41:51.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是什么呀 新西兰几维猪之王?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.54,0:41:55.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得是松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.07,0:41:58.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们 大个子小白脸!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.16,0:42:00.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我的领域尽情享受阳光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.16,0:42:03.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是松鼠 - 对 是松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.66,0:42:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于你们赶走伏狼 我以最诚挚的谢意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.05,0:42:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 狐狼? - 伏狼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:14.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们总是侵入我们的领地 破坏我们的晚会
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.26,0:42:16.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打断我们的四肢 - 是的 听起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.34,0:42:19.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 我们只是 我们只是在找哪里有人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.10,0:42:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天! 你的牙齿好大! 人类!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:25.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,真为你感到羞愧 莫里斯! 你没发现你在侮辱这些怪物吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.43,0:42:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们必须告诉我 你们到底是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.02,0:42:33.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是亚里克斯 那个亚里克斯 这是格洛瑞尔 马蒂和梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.19,0:42:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些巨人是从哪里来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.53,0:42:38.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们从纽约来 我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.11,0:42:41.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,为纽约来的巨人们欢呼!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.45,0:42:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约巨人!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.00,0:42:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在做什么? 某种近亲繁殖项目?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.09,0:42:51.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们只要问问这些傻瓜人类在哪里就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.59,0:42:54.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们这些傻瓜也有人类
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.51,0:42:58.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 这些傻瓜有人类!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.08,0:43:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 好呀 好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.64,0:43:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在那上面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.39,0:43:10.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们喜欢人类吗? 尽管不是太活跃的一群
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.90,0:43:11.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.20,0:43:14.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你们有没有活着的人类呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.62,0:43:17.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 只有死人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 如果我们这里有很多活人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:24.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里不会叫作"野生世界"了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.29,0:43:25.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,野生世界?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.79,0:43:28.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:34.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,住在泥浆小屋里? 用野生树叶清理你自己?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁清理? - 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.84,0:43:39.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪! - 大家一起!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.64,0:43:41.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.64,0:43:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,能允许我离开一会儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.43,0:43:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我离开这里! 我们得离开这里!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.82,0:43:54.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救命! - 你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.44,0:43:56.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要游回纽约去!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.91,0:43:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我不会游泳! 不过我必须得试试!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.91,0:44:03.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会游泳! - 我说过我没有机会了!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.42,0:44:08.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,大自然! 全在我身上了! 把它弄下来! 我看不见了! 我看不见了!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.12,0:44:12.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能看见!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.12,0:44:16.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 很显然 这其中有点小小的误会
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.43,0:44:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类并不是故意把我们丢在这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.80,0:44:23.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们一旦发现发生了什么 他们就会回来找我们 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.22,0:44:24.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是 对的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.22,0:44:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么用言语形容 可我们生来就是自由的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.64,0:44:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 我敢说他们已经在找我们的路上了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:43.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 兄弟们 我们的早餐 将是冰冻寿司
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.12,0:44:47.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,里科
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.05,0:44:54.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我命中注定在这座孤岛上死去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.13,0:44:56.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 梅尔曼 门科维兹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.64,0:45:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,在身体健康 神志清醒的状态下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.14,0:45:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,将我的财产平均分给你们三个人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.73,0:45:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 对不起 亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.01,0:45:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 一个厕所 做得不错 梅尔曼 还是户外抽水的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.73,0:45:13.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 这不是厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.82,0:45:17.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是坟墓 你把梅尔曼送进了坟墓 你高兴了?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.86,0:45:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.44,0:45:22.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是世界末日 这是一个崭新的开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.94,0:45:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这对我们来说再好不过
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.28,0:45:27.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是不是不是不是!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.37,0:45:31.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是不是不是不是不是不是! 这对我们来说一点都不好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.87,0:45:35.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的生日愿望被诅咒了 给我们都带来了霉运
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.87,0:45:38.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要告诉我们你的愿望? 你不应该那样做!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 我不想告诉你们的 还记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是你们让我说出来的 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.88,0:45:48.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,另外 这不是霉运 这是好运
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:51.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看我们周围吧 没有围栏 没有作息时间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.47,0:45:53.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,多美的地方啊 我们生来就
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.06,0:45:56.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 我要阻止这一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.64,0:46:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边你的岛屿活动范围 这边是我们的岛屿活动范围
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.65,0:46:04.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,在坏的那边你可以像一只神奇木马一样又蹦又跳
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,天天做你想做的该死的那些事情而这边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.74,0:46:11.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边是好的一部分 给我们这些热爱纽约想要回家的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.74,0:46:14.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 不 不! 后退 后退!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.71,0:46:16.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.66,0:46:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了! 你们呆在你那边吧 我也呆在我自己这边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.79,0:46:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你们需要我 我就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.14,0:46:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这边快乐的土地上 享受昔日好风光
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.04,0:46:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是快乐的土地! 这是快乐的土地!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.64,0:46:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都会活下去并且过得很好 直到我们回到家!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.01,0:46:35.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 美好的旧时光! - 我喜欢这片土地! 这片土地最好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.64,0:46:39.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,那边臭死了! 你就在粪池的旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.14,0:46:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 威尔玛! - 那我们现在怎么办呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.61,0:46:44.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心梅尔曼 我有自救的计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:50.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,真想看看马蒂看到这个以后他的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:56.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看他吧 没有我们 他是那么无助
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.51,0:47:08.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,住嘴 椰子头
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.56,0:47:16.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我在这里站了几个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.64,0:47:19.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还像这样摆姿势多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:22.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,她叫菲尼特!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.28,0:47:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要让所有一百万公里以内的救援队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.07,0:47:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,想念这个宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.54,0:47:33.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,当时机来临时 我们要点燃这个 自由之灯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.58,0:47:37.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,把我们从噩梦中救醒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.46,0:47:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎么样? 很酷吧 哈?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.63,0:47:43.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 自由之火怎么样了 梅尔曼? - 很好! 白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.72,0:47:45.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.17,0:47:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们为什么不借用一下马蒂的火?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.01,0:47:53.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是野生之火! 我们在自由女神身上不用野生之火
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.26,0:47:55.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快点摩擦 梅尔曼! - 我一直在做
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.85,0:48:00.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我弄不出来 我弄不出来 我弄不出来 我就是 弄不出来!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.85,0:48:02.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,火
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.36,0:48:05.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.03,0:48:09.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,着火了! 着火了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.11,0:48:14.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢天
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.92,0:48:16.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,着火了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.08,0:48:17.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不! 不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,着火了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.59,0:48:21.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 拿稳了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,跳下来! 亚里克斯 跳下来!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:26.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 狮子总能用
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.10,0:48:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,脸落地 你是什么狮子啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:40.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个疯子!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.98,0:48:43.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把它烧掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.19,0:48:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.28,0:48:48.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,真该死!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.62,0:48:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在能到快乐的一边去了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.20,0:48:55.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家静一静! 到这个洞里来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.24,0:48:58.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家静一静 别踩他尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.29,0:49:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,请把他俩分开 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.83,0:49:02.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你到这边来 你到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.21,0:49:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静下来 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.22,0:49:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢呼尊贵的什么什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.26,0:49:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么什么陛下 驾到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.73,0:49:15.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.23,0:49:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们对我们的客人“纽约巨人” 都充满了好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.06,0:49:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 维利 - 我喜欢他们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:26.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他们 我喜欢他们 我甚至在第一次见到他们之前就喜欢上他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.27,0:49:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的是的 我简直无法说出我有多喜欢他们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.11,0:49:32.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 闭嘴! 你知道你有多烦吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.41,0:49:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着! 我们还应该记得
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.50,0:49:41.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被讨厌的伏狼绑架并吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.67,0:49:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼! 伏狼来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.71,0:49:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是本食谱! 是本食谱!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.43,0:49:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,请 请 莫里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.01,0:49:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘘! 安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.97,0:49:59.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们别这样 非常时期他们不会攻击我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:03.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天才计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.78,0:50:06.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要和纽约巨人做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.28,0:50:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,和他们保持亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.28,0:50:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后有了亚里克斯先生保护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.78,0:50:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会很安全 我们就永远不必担心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.29,0:50:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶的伏狼了 永不
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.49,0:50:26.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想到的! 我想到的! 是的! 我想到的!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.20,0:50:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 大家等等 我刚刚在想
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.17,0:50:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思大家觉得为什么伏狼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.17,0:50:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么害怕亚里克斯先生呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.89,0:50:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思是我们也许也该害怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.26,0:50:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是亚里克斯先生比伏狼还可怕怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.76,0:50:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉你们 那家伙让我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.89,0:50:48.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫里斯 你没有举手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.35,0:50:52.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你的发言将被磨掉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.11,0:50:56.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有其他人觉得害怕的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:59.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有! 好的! 那别说话了!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.50,0:51:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,当纽约巨人醒来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.58,0:51:08.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要确保他们身在天堂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.59,0:51:11.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在谁想要饼干?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.48,0:51:41.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯 梅尔曼和格洛瑞尔在那边玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.49,0:51:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,再加你一个就跟好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.03,0:51:45.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.99,0:51:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 我在想 也许你应该给这个地方一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.03,0:51:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也许能过得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.00,0:51:56.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 我累了 我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.50,0:51:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.01,0:52:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能给它一个机会吗? 想想看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.51,0:52:07.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有你真的不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.66,0:52:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.12,0:52:30.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是他! - 谁呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:33.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,是送披萨的 你觉得会是谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,是? 我能为你效劳么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.46,0:52:38.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能到这边快乐的土地来么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.68,0:52:42.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.38,0:52:45.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是挺有点过分 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.61,0:52:52.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在想你说的…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.32,0:53:02.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我们的城堡! 卸下负担!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:05.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 擦一下你的脚再进来!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.16,0:53:14.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯! - 我的城堡就是你的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.17,0:53:22.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.67,0:53:25.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 来喝一杯 我请客!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.93,0:53:29.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是海水!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.35,0:53:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你别吞下去! 计划实施以前这只是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.89,0:53:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你很饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.74,0:53:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,来点大自然的恩赐怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.03,0:53:42.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有吃的?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.69,0:53:45.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,乐土的特别推荐 这就来!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.33,0:53:48.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,串串海草!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.45,0:53:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,海草? !
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.25,0:53:53.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,串串! 你尝过后就会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.01,0:54:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吃得难以想象
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.97,0:54:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 嗯 谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.43,0:54:09.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常养胃吧 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.19,0:54:13.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我还可以加点柠檬
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.20,0:54:21.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 这已经很好了 很好了 还有比这个更好的么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.70,0:54:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 还真有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.04,0:54:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.13,0:54:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 快看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.00,0:54:39.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,像是许许多多的直升飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.50,0:54:41.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,是流星! 快许个愿! 快!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.25,0:54:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔 来块又大又多汁的牛排?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.47,0:54:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道么亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证明天给你一大块牛排 撑死你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.60,0:54:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:56.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,天色已晚 我想我要…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.10,0:54:58.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我也要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.57,0:55:00.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家美梦哟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.10,0:55:32.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.15,0:55:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.73,0:55:49.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,27 28 29 30条黑的 只有29条白的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.29,0:55:52.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,似乎你的底色是黑色 再加上白色条纹
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.29,0:55:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,问题解决了 各位晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.50,0:56:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你瞧 莫里斯 亚里克斯在给他的朋友化妆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.26,0:56:11.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是多么可爱温柔的小东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.84,0:56:14.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么能觉得他很吓人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.85,0:56:18.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看他 他是那么可爱 那么帅气
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.52,0:56:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不觉得他是在给他化妆 朱利安
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:23.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得像是在舔它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.65,0:56:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便你怎么说 不管怎么样 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.31,0:56:30.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,很快我的计划就要实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.28,0:56:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.86,0:56:37.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,等他们睡熟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.37,0:56:46.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.45,0:57:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这 太讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.04,0:57:17.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒 亚里克斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.04,0:57:21.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒 亚里克斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.55,0:57:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,太阳照着屁股了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.05,0:57:27.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒 亚里克斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.55,0:57:29.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.59,0:57:30.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在吮手指头
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.84,0:57:36.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在哪里? 到底发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.51,0:57:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙滩到哪里去了? 别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.85,0:57:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁建的森林? - 别害怕 大怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.93,0:57:42.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁你们睡觉的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.02,0:57:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把你们带到了天堂的一角
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.44,0:57:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到马达加斯加!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.77,0:57:52.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马达瓦? - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.36,0:57:54.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不是瓦 是加斯加
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.42,0:58:03.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.00,0:58:06.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像是我的草地 好像回到了动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:10.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是的 伙计 那可是真家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.05,0:58:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,看哪 我觉得景色还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.13,0:58:17.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思是那是你总能看到的东西 但是它就真真实实的就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就像是真的版本 - 来赛跑怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们热血沸腾起来 让我们的肺吸入这么清新的空气
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.14,0:58:25.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁跟我一起? !
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.64,0:58:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不 我觉得我不行 你输了!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.15,0:58:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 想来玩吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.90,0:58:33.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓到你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.40,0:58:34.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.90,0:58:36.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你输了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.40,0:58:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 停下! 嘿 你疯了!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 马蒂 我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.16,0:58:44.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我输了 你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.63,0:58:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 亚里克斯 最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.13,0:58:49.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我两天没吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.13,0:58:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的血糖非常低 我觉得我没有精力了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.64,0:58:54.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得那不是问题
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.64,0:58:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先 你在野生环境里不是这么跑步的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.18,0:58:59.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计! 把你的肉垫动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.34,0:59:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只需要让你真实的那个狮子爆发出来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:04.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在 谁才是狮子? - 马蒂 我真的不
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.98,0:59:08.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你行的! 那是谁呀! 来吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.15,0:59:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这样! 我们来出出汗 你是狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.77,0:59:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁是狮子? - 你是狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.74,0:59:14.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁是狮子? - 你是狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.24,0:59:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是狮子? 谁是狮子? 谁是狮子? 谁是狮子?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.03,0:59:22.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是狮子? 谁是狮子? 谁是狮子? 谁是狮子?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:24.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.09,0:59:32.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,惊喜!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.18,0:59:41.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你输了! 你输了!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.69,0:59:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你抓不到 狮子跑得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.72,0:59:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得我在飞翔!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.36,0:59:56.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们去野外吧! - 你说的!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.37,1:00:05.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我感觉太棒了!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.88,1:00:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.88,1:00:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是享受
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.88,1:00:15.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就像你说的 宝贝 - 这地方真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.89,1:00:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对吧 梅尔曼? - 哦 是的! 是的!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.09,1:00:24.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我简直就在天堂里了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.90,1:00:29.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了 莫里斯 亚里克斯现在是我们的朋友了 再也看不到伏狼了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.98,1:00:32.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以说我的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.52,1:00:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,进行顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.24,1:00:39.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯 你应该试试这些
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.00,1:00:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好 我又觉得自己是国王了!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.08,1:00:45.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,国王?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.28,1:00:47.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的! 你应该看看他的表演!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.87,1:00:51.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 亚里克斯 给他们看看你的表演
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.37,1:00:54.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我真的不想 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:57.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 各位老人小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.80,1:00:59.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,野生环境荣誉出品:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.93,1:01:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.47,1:01:04.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,狮子王亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.27,1:01:06.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们 降E调
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.98,1:01:18.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶! 国王来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.78,1:01:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他是国王 它的王冠在那里? 我有王冠!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.44,1:01:25.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个非常好的! 就在我头上的!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.91,1:01:27.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看 我戴了吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.16,1:01:36.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,吼叫 兄弟 吼叫!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.34,1:01:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 我以前从来没听过
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.46,1:01:46.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,来个野性点的 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.51,1:01:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,来个人浪!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.51,1:02:18.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.51,1:02:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在咬我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.18,1:02:25.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 - 是的 你咬了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.77,1:02:29.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚里克斯 你做了什么? - 他咬了我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.94,1:02:32.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我没咬 我有咬吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.19,1:02:33.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好象是有的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.77,1:02:35.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你发什么神经病啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.70,1:02:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你咬我干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.78,1:02:41.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伙计 因为你是他的晚餐 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.90,1:02:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么? - 他在胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.23,1:02:48.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 莫里斯 朋友间随便咬一口没什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.82,1:02:50.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 你也来咬我一口
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.32,1:02:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,派对结束了 朱利安 你的伟大计划完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.46,1:02:56.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.30,1:02:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的朋友就是我们所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.71,1:03:01.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,豪华型猎杀机器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.39,1:03:03.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是吃肉的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是吃你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.84,1:03:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道 - 好了 好了 莫里斯 我承认
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.96,1:03:10.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的计划失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.93,1:03:14.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,全完了 我们注定要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.43,1:03:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些伏狼又会回来 把我们吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.97,1:03:21.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们都是肉类
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.66,1:03:23.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是肉类 我是! 我是! 我是!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.61,1:03:25.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯先生不可以再留在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.91,1:03:30.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他得到岛的另外那边去 和他自己的同类伏狼在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:32.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以神赋予我的权力
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.28,1:03:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照森林法则等等等等法规宣布
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.62,1:03:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上离开!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.62,1:03:39.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么? 别乱说 你看着象块牛排吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.79,1:03:41.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,对!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.09,1:03:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了吗? 我就说我不会象 等等 你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.04,1:03:46.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 非常象!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.97,1:03:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他开始变得凶残了 - 快去逃命
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.27,1:03:54.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快逃!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.62,1:04:15.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,正中靶心 打得好 莫里斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.71,1:04:16.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.30,1:04:23.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.80,1:04:27.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真抱歉 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.43,1:04:34.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:37.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗷!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.43,1:04:39.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.43,1:04:40.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都做了些什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.93,1:04:44.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是真的 我是个魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.44,1:04:46.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.82,1:07:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都做了些什么啊? 这真是个恶梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.33,1:07:03.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.21,1:07:06.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是因为我 我们失去了亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.21,1:07:07.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以做些什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.80,1:07:10.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以想办法帮助他 这就是我们要做的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.80,1:07:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.80,1:07:14.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 振作起来 我们是纽约人 对吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.42,1:07:16.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们顽强不屈 我们坚韧不拔 - 没错!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.89,1:07:18.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们无所不能! - 就是!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.73,1:07:21.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我们勇往直前 不会象那些长颈鹿一样被击倒
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.73,1:07:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我们绝不
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.26,1:07:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 格洛瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.35,1:07:28.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是我 知道吗? 是船的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.74,1:07:30.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 船! - 船?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.82,1:07:34.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,船回来接我们了! 快 伙计们 快去给他们发信号
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.19,1:07:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那儿!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.20,1:07:40.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 在这里! - 这边!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.20,1:07:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.83,1:07:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 把我顶起来 快! 把我顶起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.45,1:07:45.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊! 救命啊! 救命啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.04,1:07:48.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的脖子 我的脖子 你们这些家伙 - 这边!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.62,1:07:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼! 别动 这边! - 你们不知道这样我有多疼
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:54.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 我们在这边啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.93,1:08:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,快看! 它在调头! 它正在往回开! 它开回来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.05,1:08:03.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来! 快过来!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.39,1:08:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,真棒! 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.22,1:08:08.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们把船拦下来 我去叫亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.61,1:08:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇! 别去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一个人去了就回不来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.98,1:08:16.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这么说 我了解亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.07,1:08:18.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一听说我们得救了 他就会振作起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.24,1:08:21.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们马上就要来了 他们可以帮我们
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.82,1:08:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼说得对 人类知道应该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.83,1:08:27.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在先把船拦下来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.18,1:08:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是个象样的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.15,1:08:51.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你们? ! 哦 天 那人在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.60,1:08:53.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把他们杀了 吃了他们的肝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.61,1:08:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,骗到你了 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.66,1:08:59.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,和你开玩笑啦 宝贝儿 他们没事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.19,1:09:02.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们正搭救生艇慢慢摇去中国
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:05.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我认识你们俩的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.20,1:09:09.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,那头神经兮兮的狮子和我们那个黑白朋友去哪儿了?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.00,1:09:13.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂? 他就在 他去哪儿了 他刚刚还在我们后面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.71,1:09:17.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,他回去找亚里克斯了 他会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.68,1:09:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 伙计们 我们的黑白朋友有难
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.80,1:09:22.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来我们有事可干了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.88,1:09:25.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,船长日记 写:进入危险区域
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.47,1:09:29.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,科娃斯基 我们得去赢得当地居民的心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.47,1:09:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,里科 我们需要特殊的作战武器
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.98,1:09:34.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将要面对异常严重的危险
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.51,1:09:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,二等兵可能会牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.79,1:09:46.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 出来 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.79,1:09:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,有船来了! 我们可以回家了!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.67,1:10:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.18,1:10:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.18,1:10:12.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 亚里克斯! 亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.93,1:10:14.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.27,1:10:17.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.07,1:10:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.77,1:10:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,振作起来 亚里克斯 船回来接我们了 我们可以离开这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.36,1:10:28.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以回到文明社会去 所有的事都会象以前那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.75,1:10:30.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.33,1:10:32.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.34,1:10:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是个魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.51,1:10:38.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯 你不是魔鬼 你是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.63,1:10:41.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是一个团队 你和我 还记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.85,1:10:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.14,1:11:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:27.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不走我也不走
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.11,1:11:46.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯? 我在想一首歌
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.19,1:11:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,一首很棒的歌 我知道你一定很熟悉这首歌
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.83,1:11:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,开始广布消息
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.84,1:12:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我将离开
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.29,1:12:04.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们组成了家
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.88,1:12:11.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你知道那个词的 那两个小小的字
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.14,1:12:14.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了 别让我自己一个人唱这首歌
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.72,1:12:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不想听到自己独自唱这首歌的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.70,1:12:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 亚里克斯? 你可以出来一下吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.45,1:12:28.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 亚里克斯 我需要你帮点小忙
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.54,1:12:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,救我!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.04,1:12:34.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯! 救命啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.46,1:12:42.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊! 有没有人可以救救我! 快来人啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.93,1:12:58.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼? - 宝贝 是我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.73,1:13:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,快逃!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.65,1:13:05.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 接下来怎么办? - 就这么办
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.94,1:13:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伏狼饿了 - 伏狼要吃东西
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.53,1:13:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,就只有这么办吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.61,1:13:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许动 伏狼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.61,1:13:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼 噢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.95,1:13:18.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼 啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.17,1:13:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼 噢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.96,1:13:26.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼 啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.93,1:13:28.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来享用吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.13,1:13:30.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,伏狼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 扁你 - 伏狼 噢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.86,1:13:47.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,实在太多狼了 船长
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.45,1:13:50.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,能和你们一起战斗到底真好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.74,1:13:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.63,1:14:00.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.13,1:14:01.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.97,1:14:08.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯饿了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.25,1:14:11.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,亚里克斯要吃东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.66,1:14:29.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,到我们表演了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.11,1:14:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你没有放弃我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.61,1:14:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计 你差点把我吓出心脏病来 不能因为你是头狮子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.67,1:14:41.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就可以这么偷偷摸摸地来吓我 我们继续演下去 继续演
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.86,1:14:44.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们马上就可以脱困了 伙计们 只要你们和我配合就行
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.09,1:14:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,就想我说的 到表演的时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.96,1:14:50.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.51,1:14:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.60,1:14:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们全都是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.35,1:15:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽之王来了 哦 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.44,1:15:02.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别吃我! - 他又大又面目狰狞!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.44,1:15:05.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你们见识见识我的凶猛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.89,1:15:09.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不想那么年轻就死! - 你真是个魔鬼! 魔鬼!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:12.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你! - 我?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.62,1:15:21.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想尝尝这个吗? 嗯! 你们最好赶快去逃命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.54,1:15:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 赶快叫警察! - 他有神经病啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.92,1:15:34.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我的领地 明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.39,1:15:39.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我再也不要见到你们在我的地盘上出现
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.48,1:15:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,卜!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.49,1:15:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,呜呼! 你这只狮子!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.86,1:15:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我兄弟回来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.58,1:15:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,拥抱一下! 我的计划成功了! 计划成功了! 我可真聪明!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.37,1:16:05.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,来 该跳机器舞了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.79,1:16:07.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是聪明的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.79,1:16:10.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是超级天才
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.29,1:16:12.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是猴子的机器国王
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.04,1:16:16.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 计算 计算 - 那 午餐吃什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.80,1:16:20.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 闭上眼睛 - 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.88,1:16:22.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 闭上嘛 - 都闭上了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.39,1:16:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 紧紧闭着 - 好的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.39,1:16:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不许偷看 - 闭着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.19,1:16:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,里科
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.78,1:16:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.36,1:16:35.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,张开嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.45,1:16:38.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,装好弹药 可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.07,1:16:42.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,认真咀嚼 仔细品尝味道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.49,1:16:45.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那么? - 不错吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.25,1:16:46.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好吧 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.08,1:16:49.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果不喜欢 这里还有备用的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.05,1:16:52.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个比牛排好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱吃 我真爱吃!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.05,1:16:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这狮子喜欢吃鱼哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.89,1:17:02.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们来干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.09,1:17:05.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,有的时候这家伙会让你屁股疼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.09,1:17:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我说的 我身有体会
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.60,1:17:10.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,可这狮子也象我们证实了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.13,1:17:12.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他有一颗宽大的心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.85,1:17:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 敬 亚里克斯 - 敬 亚里克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.86,1:17:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了! 不许再吐了!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.33,1:17:28.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么说? 我们要回纽约吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.53,1:17:31.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我是说 这是你的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.12,1:17:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定你放弃?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.17,1:17:35.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎我们在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.21,1:17:38.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们可以在一起 哪里都行
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.33,1:17:39.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,那 如果是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.35,1:17:43.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 里科 我要300份外买
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.38,1:17:44.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.85,1:17:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你走之前 我有件事要宣布
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.72,1:17:51.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以大家请安静一下 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.81,1:17:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,在经过深思熟虑之后
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.40,1:17:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我决定要感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.45,1:18:01.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,为我们的家园带来的和平
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.45,1:18:03.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了好好感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.45,1:18:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要送你这个可爱的告别礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.16,1:18:08.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我不能接受 真的 我不可以拿走你的皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.16,1:18:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的啦 我弄了顶更大的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.74,1:18:12.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面还有只壁虎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.75,1:18:15.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,看他跳舞 来 斯代维 来!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.38,1:18:19.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见了 小毛球! - 谢谢你做的所有的事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.00,1:18:21.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见! - 回见!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.47,1:18:23.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见啦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.47,1:18:26.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见了哦! - 回头见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.06,1:18:29.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫里斯 我胳膊累了 帮我挥着
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.06,1:18:32.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,挥快点 淘气的小猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.48,1:18:35.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们到纽约的时候 已经是深冬了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.60,1:18:37.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我在想 那我们还赶什么路呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.07,1:18:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许路上我们可以去些别的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.07,1:18:43.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 比如巴黎 - 我正想说那里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.58,1:18:46.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想去西班牙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.08,1:18:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要不斐济 - 可以去加拿大吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.62,1:18:50.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿药便宜
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.58,1:18:53.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实我不介意什么时候再回到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.59,1:18:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也没问题 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.01,1:18:58.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 船长? - 我一直想去澳洲
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.79,1:19:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们是不是要告诉他们那船没油了?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.33,1:19:03.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.80,1:19:07.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,只用微笑着挥手就是了 小伙子们 微笑着挥手
